# {{title}}

A Garry's Mod addon. It runs on any gamemode: the game runs `lua/autorun/{{id}}.lua` on the
server and on the clients, which includes the files in `lua/{{id}}/` by the realm their
`sh_`, `sv_` or `cl_` prefix names.

## Installation

Copy this folder into `garrysmod/addons/` of the server, or link it there while you work on it:

```sh
ln -s <path to this checkout> <server>/garrysmod/addons/{{id}}
```

## Packaging

The folder is also an fpkg package (`packagespec.lua`), so fpkg validates it and builds an
archive of it:

```sh
fpkg check
fpkg pack --list
```

fpkg does not bundle dependencies into addons yet. `addon.json` keeps `packagespec.lua`, this
file and the git files out of a Workshop upload.
